    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f67b66224727ec138bc435ea",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“有马纪念”。\n对丸善斯基来说，这是场颇有因缘的比赛。\n原本她说不定能在此遇上命中注定的劲敌……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a277dafbdea70150b80ca9013e8621f327fccf00e8237277040eb97b9f513db",
