    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad571c8d567656a52f3572e6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过，现在丸善斯基的劲敌是我！\n樱花千代王鼓足气势，\n燃起一定要赢得有马的斗志。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f10a4502111137c4ea8f08e114113283155f6048e072b84523dcdafb166cb989",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
