    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3dd1b86a49990dd31dddcfd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这是两人继承某种命运的对决吗？\n……不，是只有现在的她们才能实现，\n震撼人心的欢乐飨宴。",
      "source_fingerprint": "190043871c15e1d8367e93a5efe9f535b31681fedf2da215128369192754c012",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
