    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa7e6d28329684255b4a2a59",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了赢得德比实现梦想，\n她决定接下来将挑战\n与德比同等级的GⅠ竞赛“朝日杯FS”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac5e03392f9fa9044b4aa3ad37215d7715869d502be932ad852125636d29ba42",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6fa527f2bf7f44c484b6548a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dbf05d4eb4a3306738a6a256",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "八重无敌与目白阿尔丹\n亲耳从她口中听到这个消息。",
      "source_fingerprint": "121bf896fad967ed5d62e7dc71313011da45c5401eba7808b928d06413368c85",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:870c7d9768d133dd6db5066d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:770f069b146c564f0d170c50",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是八重无敌对樱花千代王宣告，\n为了见证“你露出锋芒眼神的瞬间”，\n届时她会亲临朝日杯FS观战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca13ac837aed1e5097b0315ab3c477638e15eab0063f577bb5afc985a40652f3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c07399c112021a9c7200d7ea",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "出道战结束后・首先是第一步",
      "source_fingerprint": "f851f3e2bab93245855912142934d94a7ebcda917abed07b441376bbe3b2384c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f473cc2f1974a16d2613cd6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "奔跑时，樱花千代王双眸中的梦想\n如同火焰般熊熊燃烧。\n让八重无敌笃定她就是自己的好对手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6738ce60fc905e899c6c839214bdbbebfdd87f59723e5f9d32b5f5f76a3a189",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d1ddafd88c39fe8a8c1215d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "八重无敌直到晚上都还在持续进行自主训练。\n看见她努力的模样，樱花千代王再度\n深受刺激，更加鼓起了干劲。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f14be398e682dd1e2f72efec5fa9cfb127b8d887d1048090a32b5003d5db61f5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e5e566e10bd5d27315317c6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而丸善斯基则一脸开心地在旁观看。\n看着樱花千代王背负起自己托付的梦想，\n与其他选手一同切磋琢磨的模样……",
      "source_fingerprint": "3852c84c5e7b030925e24691c85126584da8ff73697a9818103a138a4d029885",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c340241be007f2c25ec58aaa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但在她身旁的千明代表却\n露出寂寞的表情，盯着她的侧脸。",
      "source_fingerprint": "550f20583a037ea2b9ea3299666f4d8f595d38c99c20a1821b4a3e3104b62f65",
